Original WestShield code extracted from the server-adapters repository:
https://github.com/samanwirst/westshield-simpleclans
Source checkpoint: a7332f3cbe30f2ba251cf6de06ab645c3cfa4390

The production Java sources and resource files are unchanged by this extraction.
Standalone build/test entry points and documentation are supplied in this repo.
The Minecraft protocol test client also originates from that repository.

Minecraft, Purpur, Paper, AuthMe, Geyser, Floodgate, SQLite JDBC and SLF4J are
independent projects with their own licenses. No server binary, authentication
plugin or database driver is bundled in the WestShieldLoot release JAR.
